# Nothing here is ever the input to a `COPY`: the Dockerfile names the paths it
# needs one by one. This file exists so the daemon is not handed a build context
# with a Cargo target directory and several node_modules trees in it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

.git
.github
.env
.env.local
compose.yaml
Dockerfile
